  "operative_text": "Sec. 5o (amending MCL 28.425o): {+(i) The Michigan State Capitol Building.+} {+(j) The Anderson House Office Building.+} {+(k) The Binsfeld Senate Office Building.+}\nSec. 5o(4) (amending MCL 28.425o): (4) [-As used in subsection (1), \"premises\" does not include parking areas of the places identified under subsection (1).-]{+ Subsection (1)(i) to (k) does not apply to an individual licensed to carry a concealed pistol under this act while that individual is serving as a member of the Michigan house of representatives or the Michigan senate.+}\nSec. 5o(7) (amending MCL 28.425o): {+(7) As used in subsection (1), \"premises\" does not include parking areas of the places identified under subsection (1).+}"
